  "body": "There are already a lot of use cases covered in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#autofill but the spec is currently missing autofill options for IBAN/BIC fields. This is useful for payment forms that are no credit card forms.\n\nFiled the issue here as suggested by Anne. https://twitter.com/annevk/status/745248845932683265\n",
